1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,120
If I had to start from zero tomorrow and bring in new customers fast,

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:05,520
here's exactly what I would build from top to bottom.

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:08,080
I would start with an ad, open ChatGPT or Claude,

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:10,320
paste in what you sell and who you sell it to.

5
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:12,640
Ask it to write you 10 different hooks for a meta ad,

6
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:15,680
pick the best 3, and then jump into Higgsfield.ai

7
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,040
and have it generate the visual.

8
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:19,120
30 minutes and you got a real ad ready to run.

9
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,760
You run the ad to one landing page, not your homepage.

10
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,920
One page, one offer, one call to action.

11
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:26,320
Headline that stops the scroll, a few lines of value,

12
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,120
an email or a phone field, and a button, and that's it.

13
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:31,680
You can build it in high level, a company we partnered with,

14
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:32,640
in less than 20 minutes.

15
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:35,600
The second someone enters their email, they drop into your CRM,

16
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,680
automatically tagged from where they came from.

17
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:40,080
Now the part that most people skip, the follow up.

18
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:41,920
The moment that form field is filled,

19
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:44,080
a sequence gets kicked off automatically.

20
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:46,720
Email or SMS, spaced over 5 to 7 days.

21
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:49,360
First message thanks them and delivers what you promise,

22
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:50,960
then a story, then social proof,

23
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:54,000
then objection you know that they have, then the offer.

24
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,200
They don't have to think about you,

25
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:57,520
you're showing up in their inbox and text,

26
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,120
exactly at the right time.

27
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:00,800
The last message has a calendar link,

28
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:02,480
or a buy button right inside it.

29
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:04,400
They tap, they book, or they buy.

30
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,440
AI does the creative work.

31
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:06,960
The system runs a customer journey.

32
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:08,720
You spend your time on strategy.

33
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:09,440
That's the play.
